"description":"Join over 3 million riders and experience the ultimate motorcycle navigation with calimoto!\n\nAre you looking for an app to make your motorcycle ride even curvier and more exciting? Start your adventure now! With calimoto, you can plan your journeys, enjoy precision motorcycle navigation, save every road trip via GPS tracking, and get inspired by the riding community.\n\nWhether you are cruising through the canyons or exploring local backroads: Our unique algorithm ensures every route is even curvier than you thought possible. We provide specialized scenic motorcycle navigation that loves twists and turns while avoiding boring highways.\n\nAPPLE CARPLAY INTEGRATION\nExperience your GPS navigation directly on your bike's display! With full CarPlay integration, you have your motorcycle routes and the route planner right in your line of sight. It is the perfect extension for your cockpit, allowing you to focus on the road while following your trip planner.\n\nWHY CALIMOTO IS THE NO. 1 CHOICE FOR EVERY MOTORCYCLE RIDE:\n1. Individual Route Planner: Create your motorcycle routes as curvier as you like – directly in the app or via the web.\n2. Turn-by-Turn GPS Navigation: Clear voice instructions for your navigation, so you can keep your eyes on the road.\n3. Points of Interest (POIs): Your motorcycle GPS leads you directly to gas stations, restaurants, and famous biker hangouts.\n4. GPX Feature: Import external motorcycle routes from other apps or use calimoto as your primary route planner for exports.\n5. Offline Maps: Reliable GPS navigation and precise tracking even without an internet connection in remote areas.\n\nMAXIMUM FUN FOR EVERY MOTORCYCLE ADVENTURE\nNo matter what motorbike you ride: Activate the tracker to analyze data like lean angle and acceleration after every road trip. Our specialized navigation is more than just a simple motorcycle app – it is your digital companion for a true moto feeling. Make your next outing even more scenic with our route planner, discover hidden twisties, and share your highlights in the community.\n\nUPGRADE TO PREMIUM FOR THE ULTIMATE NAVIGATION\nTake your scenic motorcycle navigation to the next level:\nWorldwide offline maps and unlimited motorcycle routes\nGPS navigation with speed limits and hazard warnings\nProfessional analysis for your motorcycle: lean angle and acceleration data\n\nDownload the calimoto app today! Turn every journey into a scenic adventure with the most advanced motorcycle route planner and GPS navigation available.\n\nTerms of Use (T&C): https://calimoto.com/gtc-current\nPrivacy Policy: https://calimoto.com/en/information/privacy-policy", "minimumOsVersion":"17.2", "formattedPrice":"Free", "fileSizeBytes":"210681856", "sellerUrl":"https://calimoto.com", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":965, "languageCodesISO2A":["CS", "NL", "EN", "FR", "DE", "IT", "NB", "PL", "PT", "RU", "SK", "ES", "SV"], "trackContentRating":"4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.5968900000000001426769813406281173229217529296875, "userRatingCount":965}]
